---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | kirkr.xyz" description="About this site and its author.">
	<div class="flex min-h-[calc(100dvh-4rem)] flex-col items-center px-6 py-6 md:py-16">
		<main class="w-full max-w-[600px]">
			<div class="py-4">
				<h1 class="font-serif text-[48px] leading-tight text-ink">
					About<span class="opacity-40">.</span>
				</h1>
			</div>
			<div class="mb-8 h-px bg-bd"></div>
			<p class="font-sans text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-80">
				I’m a computer engineering student at Warwick. The site is built with Astro and is a place
				to keep notes, collect things I like, and share what I’m working on.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-5 font-sans text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-80">
				I like quite a wide range of music, starting from The Beatles and Bob Dylan to contemporary
				artists like Bladee, Yung Lean, Drake, Ye, as well as classical music, particularly Mozart
				and Bach. My favourite directors are Kubrick, Sidney Lumet, and Billy Wilder — I like all
				kinds of films but my favourites are Amadeus (1984), Fail Safe (1964), Clue (1985), and
				Paris, Texas (1984).
			</p>
			<p class="mt-5 font-sans text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-80">
				I’ve always liked history, particularly the Dutch Golden Age and its painters, for a long
				time I created/edited wikipedia pages on the subject. Though my most recent readings have
				been in philosophy, such as the works of Sartre, Nietzsche, and Voltaire, I am more
				generally interested in classics, mainly of early-to-mid twentieth century Japanese novels
				(e.g. Mishima, Matsumoto).
			</p>
			<figure class="mt-10">
				<img
					src="/friedrich-monk-by-the-sea.webp"
					alt="The Monk by the Sea, by Caspar David Friedrich"
					width="720"
					height="458"
					style="aspect-ratio: 720 / 458"
					class="h-auto w-full rounded-sm object-cover"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
				<figcaption class="mt-6 text-center font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-ink-70">
					Caspar David Friedrich - The Monk by the Sea
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<Footer />
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
